{"4738100":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"10 Million Pixels","steam_appid":4738100,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5358150],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A short incremental game about mining  pixels to find the one golden pixel.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shoot balls to mine pixels. Use the mined pixels as a currency to shoot more balls. Explore the procedurally generated environment to find special upgrade-pixels that can be used for unlocking new balls and upgrading their unique ball-abilities. Dig out hidden objects and find the Golden Pixel, hidden somewhere among the 10 million pixels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/a3e62e184b8fdbf7d27287fec0ec0762.avif?t=1793284763\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras_big\/a3e62e184b8fdbf7d27287fec0ec0762.webp?t=1793284763 width=1560 height=186 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/f8fb8dae9d2312368cec0e1ffe4e364a.poster.avif?t=1793284763\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/f8fb8dae9d2312368cec0e1ffe4e364a.webm?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/f8fb8dae9d2312368cec0e1ffe4e364a.mp4?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/165336cf0ee43744ac5da07be069c284.avif?t=1793284763\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras_big\/165336cf0ee43744ac5da07be069c284.webp?t=1793284763 width=1560 height=186 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/3755aa6a0cce73e89718a9d1bb23a206.poster.avif?t=1793284763\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/3755aa6a0cce73e89718a9d1bb23a206.webm?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/3755aa6a0cce73e89718a9d1bb23a206.mp4?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/db8bbf21aa75f5f6a6ae6b2e6ff4a933.avif?t=1793284763\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras_big\/db8bbf21aa75f5f6a6ae6b2e6ff4a933.webp?t=1793284763 width=1560 height=186 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/161c609353c11fcebdf47325c715f72a.poster.avif?t=1793284763\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/161c609353c11fcebdf47325c715f72a.webm?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/161c609353c11fcebdf47325c715f72a.mp4?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/ca988e90ec3bac4a32327296005e4a77.avif?t=1793284763\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras_big\/ca988e90ec3bac4a32327296005e4a77.webp?t=1793284763 width=1560 height=186 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/76b91b2c6625827b544137e73cfea0c8.poster.avif?t=1793284763\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/76b91b2c6625827b544137e73cfea0c8.webm?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/76b91b2c6625827b544137e73cfea0c8.mp4?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover A Huge World<\/strong>: Explore a huge world of 10 million mineable pixels. (For reference, the world is 1000x bigger than the what you see in the GIF above)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted &amp; Procedural<\/strong>: The procedurally generated mineable environment makes every play through unique. Hidden inside the world you will find solid objects that have been carefully handcrafted.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Balls With Unique Abilities<\/strong>: Each ball color has a unique ability. The Blue Directional Ball only goes in a straight vertical or horizontal line. The Red Smash Ball hits pixels in a surrounding area upon impact. The Green Poison Ball poisons pixels upon impact, and will erode the pixels over time while spreading to nearby pixels. And more! <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balls Go Brrrr!<\/strong>: The game physics supports thousands of balls, simultaneously bouncing around and breaking pixels, at a stable 60+ FPS frame rate. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music by Pulsewith:<\/strong> An amazing soundtrack by Pulsewith (Justin Skomarovsky) who previously made the music for The Loopler.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A short incremental game about mining  pixels to find the one golden pixel.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shoot balls to mine pixels. Use the mined pixels as a currency to shoot more balls. Explore the procedurally generated environment to find special upgrade-pixels that can be used for unlocking new balls and upgrading their unique ball-abilities. Dig out hidden objects and find the Golden Pixel, hidden somewhere among the 10 million pixels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/a3e62e184b8fdbf7d27287fec0ec0762.avif?t=1793284763\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras_big\/a3e62e184b8fdbf7d27287fec0ec0762.webp?t=1793284763 width=1560 height=186 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/f8fb8dae9d2312368cec0e1ffe4e364a.poster.avif?t=1793284763\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/f8fb8dae9d2312368cec0e1ffe4e364a.webm?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/f8fb8dae9d2312368cec0e1ffe4e364a.mp4?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/165336cf0ee43744ac5da07be069c284.avif?t=1793284763\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras_big\/165336cf0ee43744ac5da07be069c284.webp?t=1793284763 width=1560 height=186 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/3755aa6a0cce73e89718a9d1bb23a206.poster.avif?t=1793284763\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/3755aa6a0cce73e89718a9d1bb23a206.webm?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/3755aa6a0cce73e89718a9d1bb23a206.mp4?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/db8bbf21aa75f5f6a6ae6b2e6ff4a933.avif?t=1793284763\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras_big\/db8bbf21aa75f5f6a6ae6b2e6ff4a933.webp?t=1793284763 width=1560 height=186 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/161c609353c11fcebdf47325c715f72a.poster.avif?t=1793284763\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/161c609353c11fcebdf47325c715f72a.webm?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/161c609353c11fcebdf47325c715f72a.mp4?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/ca988e90ec3bac4a32327296005e4a77.avif?t=1793284763\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras_big\/ca988e90ec3bac4a32327296005e4a77.webp?t=1793284763 width=1560 height=186 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/76b91b2c6625827b544137e73cfea0c8.poster.avif?t=1793284763\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/76b91b2c6625827b544137e73cfea0c8.webm?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/extras\/76b91b2c6625827b544137e73cfea0c8.mp4?t=1793284763\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover A Huge World<\/strong>: Explore a huge world of 10 million mineable pixels. (For reference, the world is 1000x bigger than the what you see in the GIF above)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted &amp; Procedural<\/strong>: The procedurally generated mineable environment makes every play through unique. Hidden inside the world you will find solid objects that have been carefully handcrafted.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Balls With Unique Abilities<\/strong>: Each ball color has a unique ability. The Blue Directional Ball only goes in a straight vertical or horizontal line. The Red Smash Ball hits pixels in a surrounding area upon impact. The Green Poison Ball poisons pixels upon impact, and will erode the pixels over time while spreading to nearby pixels. And more! <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balls Go Brrrr!<\/strong>: The game physics supports thousands of balls, simultaneously bouncing around and breaking pixels, at a stable 60+ FPS frame rate. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music by Pulsewith:<\/strong> An amazing soundtrack by Pulsewith (Justin Skomarovsky) who previously made the music for The Loopler.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Mine through millions of pixels to find the Golden Pixel. A mesmerizing incremental game about exploration and erosion.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/446f975f0cf7a392a409bb08b8a5090f12b9fba5\/header.jpg?t=1793284763","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/0bac08f20bbf1c122224b1778d2a01c3b6a2d6cd\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793284763","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738100\/0bac08f20bbf1c122224b1778d2a01c3b6a2d6cd\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793284763","website":"https:\/\/impress.games\/press-kit\/battle-lab\/10-million-pixels","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<